==English==
{{wikipedia}}
[[Image:Litchi chinensis Luc Viatour.jpg|thumb|Lychees]]

===Alternative forms===
* {{l|en|leechee}}, {{l|en|lichee}}, {{l|en|lichi}}, {{l|en|litchi}}

===Etymology===
From {{der|en|yue|荔枝|tr=lai<sup>6</sup> zi<sup>1</sup>}}.

===Pronunciation===
* {{IPA|/ˈlaɪ̯t͡ʃiː/|/ˈliːt͡ʃiː/|lang=en}}

===Noun===
{{en-noun}}

# The [[Chinese]] tropical fruit [[tree]] ''[[Litchi chinensis]]'', of the [[soapberry]] family.
# That tree's bright red oval [[fruit]] with a single [[stone]] surrounded by a fleshy white [[aril]].

